g CLI session quickly may cause the Aaa agent to run out of resources and either fail the command or restart. Running watch cmd may trigger this bug. Please refer release notes', 'alertNote': 'When command authorization or accounting is configured, continuously creating interactive CLI session quickly may cause the Aaa agent to run out of resources and either fail the command or restart. When the switch is in this state, new connections to the switch (including SSH/TELNET/CAPI) will fail, and may recover when new connections are stopped. In some EOS versions processes such as sshd or CapiApp may also generate coredumps.', 'product': 'eos', 'versionIntroduced': ['4.20.1'], 'versionFixed': ['4.22.10', '4.23.8', '4.24.6', '4.25.2'], 'bites': 8, 'lastBiteTime': 1718330736, 'exportedTime': 1672531200, 'releaseNote': 'When command authorization or accounting is configured, continuously creating interactive CLI session quickly may cause the Aaa agent to run out of resources and either fail the command or restart. When the switch is in this state, new connections to the switch (including SSH/TELNET/CAPI) will fail, and may recover when new connections are stopped. In some EOS versions processes such as sshd or CapiApp may also generate coredumps.'}, {'bugId': 490501, 'severity': 'sev2', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': 'PTP timestamps may occasionally jump 4 seconds back in time. The switch will recover on its own after a few minutes of synchronizing with the PTP grandmaster again.', 'alertNote': 'PTP timestamps may occasionally jump 4 seconds back in time. The switch will recover on its own after a few minutes of synchronizing with the PTP grandmaster again.', 'product': 'eos', 'versionIntroduced': ['4.23.0'], 'versionFixed': ['4.23.5', '4.24.2'], 'bites': 3, 'lastBiteTime': 1613064379, 'exportedTime': 1698105600, 'releaseNote': 'PTP timestamps may occasionally jump 4 seconds back in time. The switch will recover on its own after a few minutes of synchronizing with the PTP grandmaster again.', 'conjunction': [[{'tag': 'CCS-720XP'}, {'tag': 'PTPEnabledInterface'}]]}, {'bugId': 491230, 'severity': 'sev2', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': '  MBA MAC move does not  work to a unauthorized port.', 'alertNote': 'If an MBA supplicant is not assigned a dynamic VLAN when it is authenticated on a port, and if the supplicant later moves to a new port which is in unauthorized state, MBA authentication on the new port will not succeed and the port will continue to stay in unauthorized state.', 'product': 'eos', 'versionIntroduced': ['1.0.0'], 'versionFixed': ['4.30.2'], 'bites': 1, 'lastBiteTime': 1649149582, 'exportedTime': 1740528000, 'releaseNote': 'If an MBA supplicant is not assigned a dynamic VLAN when it is authenticated on a port, and if the supplicant later moves to a new port which is in unauthorized state, MBA authentication on the new port will not succeed and the port will continue to stay in unauthorized state.', 'conjunction': [[{'tag': 'dot1xMacBasedAuthAlways'}, {'tag': 'Strata'}]]}, {'bugId': 491678, 'severity': 'sev3', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': '/var/log/lastlog is missing at boot time. It is created only after running the "sudo" bash command.', 'alertNote': '/var/log/lastlog is missing at boot time. It is created only after running the "sudo" bash command.', 'product': 'eos', 'versionIntroduced': ['4.23.1'], 'versionFixed': ['4.23.5', '4.24.3', '4.25.0'], 'bites': 1, 'lastBiteTime': 1591918862, 'exportedTime': 1672531200, 'releaseNote': '/var/log/lastlog is missing at boot time. It is created only after running the "sudo" bash command.'}, {'bugId': 492384, 'severity': 'sev3', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': "In certain scenario, the GRPC messages from Sfe to the bess datapath are not received and the IPsec SA's do not get programmed in the bess datapath.", 'alertNote': "In certain scenario, the GRPC messages from Sfe to the bess datapath