n a tx timeout happens in the tg3 driver that is used for management interfaces, dumping the chip registers takes around 3 seconds and can prevent some protocols from running in a timely manner, this could lead to problems such as BFD or BGP flaps.', 'product': 'eos', 'versionIntroduced': ['1.0.0'], 'versionFixed': ['4.26.6', '4.27.5', '4.28.1'], 'bites': 12, 'lastBiteTime': 1737687577, 'exportedTime': 1786406400, 'releaseNote': 'When a tx timeout happens in the tg3 driver that is used for management interfaces, dumping the chip registers takes around 3 seconds and can prevent some protocols from running in a timely manner, this could lead to problems such as BFD or BGP flaps.', 'conjunction': [[{'tag': 'BFDenabled'}]]}, {'bugId': 668718, 'severity': 'sev1', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': 'When segment security features are configured on a switch and interfaces flap, some Layer3 routed traffic trying to egress some L3 interfaces may result in L3 MTU check failures and get software forwarded.', 'alertNote': 'When segment security features are configured on a switch and interfaces flap, some Layer3 routed traffic trying to egress some L3 interfaces may result in L3 MTU check failures and get software forwarded. The workaround is to restart StrataL3 agent or reload the switch.', 'product': 'eos', 'versionIntroduced': ['4.25.2'], 'versionFixed': ['4.25.9', '4.26.6', '4.27.4', '4.28.0'], 'bites': 1, 'lastBiteTime': 1674728835, 'exportedTime': 1698105600, 'releaseNote': 'When segment security features are configured on a switch and interfaces flap, some Layer3 routed traffic trying to egress some L3 interfaces may result in L3 MTU check failures and get software forwarded. The workaround is to restart StrataL3 agent or reload the switch.', 'conjunction': [[{'tag': 'routingEnabled'}, {'tag': 'SegmentSecurityEnabled'}, {'tag': 'Strata'}]]}, {'bugId': 669251, 'severity': 'sev2', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': 'When MACsec encryption traffic spans across multiple queues encrypted packets may be sent out of order. On peer,`show mac security counters detail` will show the counter`inPktsLate` incrementing.', 'alertNote': 'When MACsec encryption traffic spans across multiple queues encrypted packets may be sent out of order. On the peer, "show mac security counters detail" will show the counter "inPktsLate" incrementing.\n\nTo work around this issue, enable a replay protection window on the peer with "replay protection window SIZE" or disable replay protection on the peer with "no replay protection".', 'product': 'eos', 'versionIntroduced': ['4.27.2'], 'versionFixed': ['4.32.10', '4.33.8', '4.34.6', '4.35.5', '4.36.1'], 'bites': 2, 'lastBiteTime': 1776597466, 'exportedTime': 1778889600, 'releaseNote': 'When MACsec encryption traffic spans across multiple queues encrypted packets may be sent out of order. On the peer, "show mac security counters detail" will show the counter "inPktsLate" incrementing.\n\nTo work around this issue, enable a replay protection window on the peer with "replay protection window SIZE" or disable replay protection on the peer with "no replay protection".', 'conjunction': [[{'tag': 'CCS-722XPM'}, {'tag': 'MacsecEnabled'}], [{'tag': 'CCS-720XDM'}, {'tag': 'MacsecEnabled'}]]}, {'bugId': 669256, 'severity': 'sev2', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': '200G ports dont operate at line rate when there is wide fan-in or if there is shaper on a queue.', 'alertNote': '200G ports dont operate at line rate when there is wide fan-in or if there is shaper on a queue.', 'product': 'eos', 'versionIntroduced': ['4.25.1'], 'versionFixed': ['4.27.12', '4.28.2'], 'bites': 1, 'lastBiteTime': 1694310264, 'exportedTime': 1700784000, 'releaseNote': '200G ports dont operate at line rate when there is wide fan-in or if there is shaper on a queue.', 'conjunction': [[{'tag': 'SandGen4'}]]}, {'bugId': 669632, 'severity': 'sev1', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary'