es (this may lead to an interface flap at the time of applying this configuration).', 'product': 'eos', 'versionIntroduced': ['1.0.0'], 'versionFixed': ['4.35.2'], 'bites': 1, 'lastBiteTime': 1668581420, 'exportedTime': 1775606400, 'releaseNote': 'Interfaces with SFP transceivers and link-debounce configuration may experience a link down debounce period double than the configured period. The workaround is to configure "phy link detection aggressive" on affected interfaces (this may lead to an interface flap at the time of applying this configuration).', 'conjunction': [[{'tag': 'LinkDebounce'}]]}, {'bugId': 703676, 'severity': 'sev1', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': 'If an active supervisor card removal results in an SSO (Stateful Switchover), the new active supervisor may get partial state update of unrelated card removal.  This may cause SSO to fail, and the switch will reboot to recover.', 'alertNote': 'If an active supervisor card removal results in an SSO (Stateful Switchover), the new active supervisor may get partial state update of unrelated card removal.  This may cause SSO to fail, and the switch will reboot to recover.', 'product': 'eos', 'versionIntroduced': ['4.20.6'], 'versionFixed': ['4.25.9', '4.26.8', '4.27.5', '4.28.2'], 'bites': 2, 'lastBiteTime': 1667391954, 'exportedTime': 1786665600, 'releaseNote': 'If an active supervisor card removal results in an SSO (Stateful Switchover), the new active supervisor may get partial state update of unrelated card removal.  This may cause SSO to fail, and the switch will reboot to recover.', 'conjunction': [[{'tag': '7300X'}, {'tag': 'ssoEnabled'}], [{'tag': '7300X3'}, {'tag': 'ssoEnabled'}], [{'tag': '7320X'}, {'tag': 'ssoEnabled'}]]}, {'bugId': 704536, 'severity': 'sev2', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': 'Interfaces may experience link flaps when running at speeds using PAM4 modulation.', 'alertNote': 'Interfaces may experience link flaps when running at speeds using