ces.", 'conjunction': [[{'tag': 'SandGen4'}, {'tag': 'subintEnabled'}]]}, {'bugId': 760674, 'severity': 'sev2', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': 'Streaming Agent (TerminAttr) may stop replicating some of its state or get stuck shutting down when printing expvars. Syslog will show messages with "%FWK-3-SOCKET_CLOSE_LOCAL: Closing connection to TerminAttr ... (stalled agent detected)".', 'alertNote': 'Streaming Agent (TerminAttr) may stop replicating some of its state or get stuck shutting down when printing expvars. Syslog will show messages with "%FWK-3-SOCKET_CLOSE_LOCAL: Closing connection to TerminAttr ... (stalled agent detected)".\nThe workaround is to restart TerminAttr.', 'product': 'terminattr', 'versionIntroduced': ['TerminAttr-v0.1'], 'versionFixed': ['TerminAttr-v1.28.3', 'TerminAttr-v1.31.0'], 'bites': 0, 'lastBiteTime': 0, 'exportedTime': 1784160000, 'releaseNote': 'Streaming Agent (TerminAttr) may stop replicating some of its state or get stuck shutting down when printing expvars. Syslog will show messages with "%FWK-3-SOCKET_CLOSE_LOCAL: Closing connection to TerminAttr ... (stalled agent detected)".\nThe workaround is to restart TerminAttr.'}, {'bugId': 760738, 'severity': 'sev1', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': 'Changing the VRF to VNI mapping in an EVPN OISM Vxlan setup may cause traffic disruption of multicast traffic. Removing and reapplying the evpn vrf configuration might fix the issue.', 'alertNote': 'Changing the VRF to VNI mapping in an EVPN OISM Vxlan setup may cause traffic disruption of multicast traffic. Removing and reapplying the evpn vrf configuration might fix the issue.', 'product': 'eos', 'versionIntroduced': ['1.0.0'], 'versionFixed': ['4.32.7', '4.33.6', '4.34.2'], 'bites': 0, 'lastBiteTime': 0, 'exportedTime': 1783468800, 'releaseNote': 'Changing the VRF to VNI mapping in an EVPN OISM Vxlan setup may cause traffic disruption of multicast traffic. Removing and reapplying the evpn vrf con