ffic loss for the affected prefixes.\n\nThe workaround is to restart the SandL3Unicast agent to restore the unprogrammed routes.\n', 'product': 'eos', 'versionIntroduced': ['4.27.2'], 'versionFixed': ['4.32.10', '4.33.0'], 'bites': 0, 'lastBiteTime': 0, 'exportedTime': 1784851200, 'releaseNote': 'When FlexRoute route compression is configured using "ip hardware fib optimize prefix-length <> compress <>", routes may fail to get programmed in hardware if the system experiences a FlexRoute resource (specifically FlexRoute-TCAM, FlexRoute-FecLevel1, FlexRoute-EcmpLevel1 resources in "show hardware capacity" output) overflow. This can result in traffic loss for the affected prefixes.\n\nThe workaround is to restart the SandL3Unicast agent to restore the unprogrammed routes.\n', 'conjunction': [[{'tag': 'Sand'}]]}, {'bugId': 960295, 'severity': 'sev2', 'securityAdvisoryURL': 'https://www.arista.com/en/support/advisories-notices/security-advisory/19905-security-advisory-0101', 'cve': 'CVE-2024-3596', 'alertSummary': 'Security Advisory 101 for CVE-2024-3596. Read more at https://www.arista.com/en/support/advisories-notices/security- advisory/19905-security-advisory-0101', 'alertNote': 'Security Advisory 101 for CVE-2024-3596. Read more at https://www.arista.com/en/support/advisories-notices/security-advisory/19905-security-advisory-0101', 'product': 'eos', 'versionIntroduced': ['1.0.0'], 'versionFixed': ['4.34.1'], 'bites': 1, 'lastBiteTime': 1748039638, 'exportedTime': 1762819200, 'releaseNote': 'Security Advisory 101 for CVE-2024-3596. Read more at https://www.arista.com/en/support/advisories-notices/security-advisory/19905-security-advisory-0101', 'conjunction': [[{'tag': 'AAAGroupServerRadius'}]]}, {'bugId': 960384, 'severity': 'sev2', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': 'Card may restart with a CARD_LOST_POWER syslog after syslogs of POWERCONTROLLER_BAD_OUTPUT_VOLTAGE with P0V75C_JE0 or P0V75C_JE1 voltages reporting higher than expected values', 'aler