ly when running some variants of the "show agent memory allocations" command. The "show agent memory allocations slab" command is run as a part of scheduled "show tech-support", thereby increasing the chance of the agent restart.\nThe workaround is to not running such command and exclude it from the "show tech-support".\nExample of the workaround:\nmanagement tech-support\n   policy show tech-support\n      exclude command show agent memory allocations slab'}, {'bugId': 995720, 'severity': 'sev3', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': 'Some routes may not program correctly when the route scale is high and there is churn in the FIB. As a workaround, updating or deleting and re-adding the incorrectly programmed route should make the route program correctly.', 'alertNote': 'Some routes may not program correctly when the route scale is high and there is churn in the FIB. \nAs a workaround, updating or deleting and re-adding the incorrectly programmed route should make the route program correctly.', 'product': 'eos', 'versionIntroduced': ['4.30.1'], 'versionFixed': ['4.30.9', '4.31.6', '4.32.3', '4.33.1'], 'bites': 1, 'lastBiteTime': 1727343672, 'exportedTime': 1747008000, 'releaseNote': 'Some routes may not program correctly when the route scale is high and there is churn in the FIB. \nAs a workaround, updating or deleting and re-adding the incorrectly programmed route should make the route program correctly.', 'conjunction': [[{'tag': 'routingEnabled'}], [{'tag': 'routingEnabled-NonDefaultVrf'}]]}, {'bugId': 995814, 'severity': 'sev1', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': 'When the Strata agent, the AsicResourceMgr agent, and the StrataLag agent are restarted, control frame may not be sent to a LAG. Remove and add the LAG members back when the agents are warm will restore the traffic.', 'alertNote': 'When the Strata agent, the AsicResourceMgr agent, and the StrataLag agent are restarted, control frames may not be sent out of a LAG.\n\nA