ls.', 'product': 'eos', 'versionIntroduced': ['1.0.0'], 'versionFixed': ['4.31.10', '4.32.9', '4.33.7', '4.34.4', '4.35.2'], 'bites': 20, 'lastBiteTime': 1780180195, 'exportedTime': 1774915200, 'releaseNote': 'The default switch chip interrupt pacing configuration may result in missed interrupts, causing a temporary pause in sending and receiving packets.  This may cause flaps in time sensitive protocols such as BFD or LACP.\n\nAs a workaround, the pacing delay may be configured manually. Contact support for more details.', 'conjunction': [[{'tag': 'Tomahawk3'}]]}, {'bugId': 1068124, 'severity': 'sev3', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': 'Streaming Agent (TerminAttr) may fail to fallback to other VRFs if the initial connection times out.', 'alertNote': 'Streaming Agent (TerminAttr) may fail to fallback to other VRFs if the initial connection times out.', 'product': 'terminattr', 'versionIntroduced': ['TerminAttr-v1.28.0'], 'versionFixed': ['TerminAttr-v1.37.7', 'TerminAttr-v1.40.4', 'TerminAttr-v1.41.1', 'TerminAttr-v1.42.0'], 'bites': 0, 'lastBiteTime': 0, 'exportedTime': 1786492800, 'releaseNote': 'Streaming Agent (TerminAttr) may fail to fallback to other VRFs if the initial connection times out.', 'conjunction': [[{'tag': 'TerminAttrMultiVrf'}]]}, {'bugId': 1068892, 'severity': 'sev3', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': 'The system fan speed may be higher than necessary for an extended period of time.', 'alertNote': 'The system fan speed may be higher than necessary for an extended period of time.', 'product': 'eos', 'versionIntroduced': ['4.15.4'], 'versionFixed': ['4.31.8', '4.32.6', '4.33.4', '4.34.1'], 'bites': 2, 'lastBiteTime': 1751887877, 'exportedTime': 1750118400, 'releaseNote': 'The system fan speed may be higher than necessary for an extended period of time.', 'conjunction': [[{'tag': 'Magpie'}]]}, {'bugId': 1069820, 'severity': 'sev3', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': '`show session-config di