wn for Multi-VTEP MLAG, EVPN VLXAN will not install alternate routes to reach the peer and any orphan hosts.', 'alertNote': 'When the peer link goes down for Multi-VTEP MLAG, EVPN VLXAN will not install alternate routes to reach the peer and any orphan hosts.', 'product': 'eos', 'versionIntroduced': ['1.0.0'], 'versionFixed': ['4.32.6', '4.33.4', '4.34.1'], 'bites': 1, 'lastBiteTime': 1740745142, 'exportedTime': 1765929600, 'releaseNote': 'When the peer link goes down for Multi-VTEP MLAG, EVPN VLXAN will not install alternate routes to reach the peer and any orphan hosts.', 'conjunction': [[{'tag': 'MultiVtepMlag'}]]}, {'bugId': 1104410, 'severity': 'sev2', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': 'BGP routes from VPN/EVPN (Type 5) address family, leaked from imported VRF to another source VRF via route-leak policy, may be incorrectly programmed in the kernel, causing misforwarding or blackholing of SW-forwarded packets in the new source VRF.\n', 'alertNote': 'BGP routes which are imported from BGP VPN or BGP EVPN (Type 5) address family and further leaked from the imported VRF to another source VRF using route-leak routing policy may not be correctly programmed in the kernel software forwarding table resulting in either misforwarding or blackholing of SW forwarded packets in the new source VRF.\n', 'product': 'eos', 'versionIntroduced': ['4.27.1'], 'versionFixed': ['4.31.8', '4.32.5', '4.33.3', '4.34.1'], 'bites': 1, 'lastBiteTime': 1739211927, 'exportedTime': 1750982400, 'releaseNote': 'BGP routes which are imported from BGP VPN or BGP EVPN (Type 5) address family and further leaked from the imported VRF to another source VRF using route-leak routing policy may not be correctly programmed in the kernel software forwarding table resulting in either misforwarding or blackholing of SW forwarded packets in the new source VRF.\n', 'conjunction': [[{'tag': 'evpnEnabled'}]]}, {'bugId': 1104776, 'severity': 'sev2', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alert