he subscription path to avoid keys, wildcards and ellipses. For instance use "/network-instances/network-instance" rather than "/network-instances/network-instance/..."', 'conjunction': [[{'tag': 'gNMIEnabled'}]]}, {'bugId': 1506222, 'severity': 'sev3', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': 'Streaming Agent (TerminAttr) may fail to stream new log files that show up in directories already being streamed.', 'alertNote': 'Streaming Agent (TerminAttr) may fail to stream new log files that show up in directories already being streamed.', 'product': 'terminattr', 'versionIntroduced': ['TerminAttr-v1.28.0'], 'versionFixed': ['TerminAttr-v1.31.18', 'TerminAttr-v1.34.15', 'TerminAttr-v1.37.15', 'TerminAttr-v1.40.15', 'TerminAttr-v1.43.11', 'TerminAttr-v1.46.0'], 'bites': 0, 'lastBiteTime': 0, 'exportedTime': 1792454400, 'releaseNote': 'Streaming Agent (TerminAttr) may fail to stream new log files that show up in directories already being streamed.'}, {'bugId': 1512625, 'severity': 'sev3', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': 'Streaming Agent (TerminAttr) may stream more log files than intended when multiple files have the same prefix.', 'alertNote': 'Streaming Agent (TerminAttr) may stream more log files than intended when multiple files have the same prefix.', 'product': 'terminattr', 'versionIntroduced': ['TerminAttr-v1.28.0'], 'versionFixed': ['TerminAttr-v1.31.18', 'TerminAttr-v1.34.15', 'TerminAttr-v1.37.15', 'TerminAttr-v1.40.15', 'TerminAttr-v1.43.11', 'TerminAttr-v1.46.0'], 'bites': 0, 'lastBiteTime': 0, 'exportedTime': 1792454400, 'releaseNote': 'Streaming Agent (TerminAttr) may stream more log files than intended when multiple files have the same prefix.'}, {'bugId': 1512923, 'severity': 'sev1', 'securityAdvisoryURL': '', 'cve': '', 'alertSummary': 'Suboptimal tuning on the POS1V2_HBM1_JE0 and POS1V2_HBM1_JE1 voltage rails may lead to power faults that require a reboot to recover', 'alertNote': 'Suboptimal tuning on the POS1V2_HBM1_